background:radial-gradient(circle, #556FE6, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 h-[500px] w-[500px] rounded-full opacity-20 blur-[120px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, #9333EA, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20 text-center"><nav class="mb-8 text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-normal text-left" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a class="hover:text-white/70" href="index.php">Home</a><span class="mx-1.5">›</span><a class="hover:text-white/70" href="services.php">Services</a><span class="mx-1.5">›</span><a class="hover:text-white/70" href="warehouse.php">Warehouse</a><span class="mx-1.5">›</span><span class="text-white/80">Two-Step Dropshipping</span></nav><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/60 mb-4" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Compliant Fulfillment from Our Warehouses</p><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Two-Step Dropshipping: Compliant Fulfillment from Our Warehouses</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-white/70" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Ship directly from suppliers to our warehouse, we prep &amp; forward. Compliant. Transparent. Done right.</p><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Two-step dropshipping is the safest way to arbitrage on Amazon and Walmart. Suppliers ship directly to our warehouses in Chicago and Atlanta. We handle prepping, scanning, and forwarding to fulfillment. No fake tracking. No retailer packaging. Just clean, compliant fulfillment.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a class="gradient-bg shadow-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white transition hover:opacity-90" href="contact.php">Learn More<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/20 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white/80 transition hover:bg-white/10" href="#pricing">See Pricing ↓</a></div><div class="mt-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-slate-100 rounded-2xl min-h-[200px] flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="text-slate-400 text-sm py-16">Warehouse process flow diagram</div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4">What is Two-Step Dropshipping?</h2><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Two-step dropshipping is when suppliers ship inventory directly to your fulfillment center instead of to buyers. You receive, inspect, prepare, and forward items to Amazon FBA, Walmart WFS, or customers. This method keeps you compliant with marketplace TOS while letting you source cheaper inventory from suppliers worldwide.</p></div><div class="mt-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-slate-100 rounded-2xl min-h-[200px] flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="text-slate-400 text-sm py-16">Two-step dropshipping process flow diagram</div></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p>Two-step dropshipping differs fundamentally from 1-step (direct shipping from supplier to customer). With two-step, you control quality, have inspection opportunity, and can add branding/prep before it reaches the marketplace. This eliminates Amazon&#x27;s fake tracking risk and keeps you in good standing with Walmart&#x27;s supplier packaging requirements. You become the logistics owner, which is exactly what the TOS allows, and often expects. The flow is simple: suppliers send bulk to our warehouse near Chicago; we scan, inspect, and apply any prep required (labeling, wrapping, safety certification); then we forward to your FBA account, WFS account, or direct to customer. Inventory sits at our warehouse for days or weeks. You pay inbound fees but control the cadence entirely.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="text-center mb-14" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Why Ecom Circles&#x27; Two-Step Service?</h2><div class="text-left max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4"><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">We operate 2 warehouses near Chicago, fully staffed and equipped to handle your inventory at scale. We scan everything, identify defects before they reach buyers, and ensure your shipments meet Amazon and Walmart prep standards. Transparent pricing. Real people. Real accountability.</p></div></div><div class="mb-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-slate-100 rounded-2xl min-h-[200px] flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="text-slate-400 text-sm py-16">Ecom Circles warehouse facility photo</div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-warehouse h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21V10a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11"></path><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 1.132-1.803l7.95-3.974a2 2 0 0 1 1.837 0l7.948 3.974A2 2 0 0 1 22 8z"></path><path d="M6 13h12"></path><path d="M6 17h12"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Real Warehouses, Real Control</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Two facilities near Chicago. You own your inventory until we ship. You see items before they leave our facility.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Compliant Prep Standards</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Amazon TOS. Walmart TOS. We follow both. No fake tracking. No retailer packaging. Your account stays clean.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Transparent Pricing</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Per-unit inbound fees. Clear per-item prep costs. No hidden surcharges. You know exactly what you&#x27;ll pay.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scan-line h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"></path><path d="M7 12h10"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Integrated Scanning</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Every SKU scanned and logged. Full inventory visibility. Export reports for your records.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Fast Forwarding</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Ship to us. We prep. Within 2-3 business days, your items forward to Amazon, Walmart, or a shipper.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Quality Assurance</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Defect identification before shipment. Damage rates under 0.5%. When issues occur, we take photos and escalate.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="process" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div class="text-center mb-16" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">How Two-Step Dropshipping Works</h2><div class="text-left max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4"><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">The process is straightforward. You provide supplier details. We receive and inspect. You review and approve. We forward. Each step is tracked and transparent.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-[#556FE6] via-[#9333EA] to-[#EC4899]"></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#556FE6] text-[#556FE6] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">1</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Arrange Supplier Shipment</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You negotiate with suppliers and arrange for them to ship directly to our Chicago warehouse address. We provide shipping instructions.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#556FE6] text-[#556FE6] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">2</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Inventory Arrives &amp; We Scan</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Your items arrive at our facility. We scan every unit, log it into your account, and photograph any damage immediately.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#556FE6] text-[#556FE6] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">3</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Quality Check &amp; Prep</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">We inspect for defects, apply required labels (Amazon barcode stickers, safety warnings, UPC labels), and shrink-wrap if needed.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#556FE6] text-[#556FE6] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">4</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">You Review Inventory</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You log in to see scanned items, photos, and prep status. You approve and confirm the inventory is correct.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#556FE6] text-[#556FE6] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">5</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">We Forward</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Once approved, we forward to your FBA account, WFS account, or another fulfillment center. Tracking provided.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#556FE6] text-[#556FE6] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">6</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Live Visibility</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Track every item from supplier warehouse through Ecom Circles to final destination. Monthly reconciliation reports.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4">Why Compliance Matters in Two-Step Dropshipping</h2><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Amazon and Walmart have strict rules about dropshipping. The difference between a suspended account and a thriving one often comes down to prep details. We handle the details so you don&#x27;t lose sleep.</p></div><div class="mt-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-slate-100 rounded-2xl min-h-[200px] flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="text-slate-400 text-sm py-16">Compliance comparison chart</div></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p>Amazon&#x27;s TOS prohibits fake tracking numbers. When 1-step dropshippers ship directly from suppliers, they often use fake tracking or generic placeholders, red flags that trigger review. Two-step eliminates this because your inventory sits at our warehouse first. Real tracking from supplier to us, real tracking from us to FBA.</p><p>Walmart requires proper packaging and labels, not retailer branding. When suppliers ship directly with retailer boxes visible, Walmart flags it. Two-step lets us re-prep, remove retailer logos, apply proper Walmart labels.</p><p>Both marketplaces prefer you owning the fulfillment layer. With two-step, you&#x27;re not hiding. You&#x27;re transparent about your supply chain. We document everything. Amazon respects that.</p><p>A two-step strategy isn&#x27;t just safer; it&#x27;s the path to long-term account health.</p></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div class="text-center mb-14" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Pricing &amp; Getting Started</h2><div class="text-left max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4"><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Two-step pricing is simple: inbound handling, per-item prep, and forwarding fees. Volume discounts available. No setup fee.</p></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white shadow-sm" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-neutral-200"><th class="px-6 py-4 text-left font-semibold text-neutral-900">Service</th><th class="px-6 py-4 text-left font-semibold text-neutral-900">Price</th><th class="px-6 py-4 text-left font-semibold text-neutral-900">Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 "><td class="px-6 py-4 font-medium text-neutral-900">FBM Fulfillment (per order)</td><td 